{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261016/photo/bkn-20261016200645008-1016_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261016211146\"/><p>美泰樓一高層單位失火，消防到場救援。</p><p>今晚(16日)7時44分，屯門富泰邨美泰樓一個高層單位發生火警，單位窗口見到火光，同時冒出陣陣濃煙。消防出動一隊煙帽隊及一條喉灌救，至晚上8時06分救熄火災。火警期間，一共有118名居民自行或由人員協助疏散，無人受傷。消息指，火災發生位置為單位睡房，火警原因仍待調查。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T13:20:22.325693+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":161,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T12:06:45+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T14:57:45.459892+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T13:17:49.681961+00:00","content_hash":"1ae4d8eb7b4ff1a53564b9d6ab6e43f25ee20aff5abe1887c2d2bfe9c75fc2e4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}